# Student register form (`/students/register`)

This is a **staff intake wizard**, not a list page. Do not apply list-page chrome (clustered filter/toggle/+, ice canvas, `fk-card` flattening) here.

It shares the enrollment application field set with `/enrollments/:id/edit` (student → academic → health → guardian → address → **installment plan** → review) plus a final **class group** step on register only. Guardian includes search/link of an existing parent. Public `/student-enrollment` and staff enrollment edit both include the **installment plan** step (plan pick + fee schedule from package advance timing) before review.

## Keep

- **Navy `FikrPageHeader`** with the pixel-square motif. Title + subtitle only. No `:eyebrow`. No back control in `#leading` on register (edit enrollment may have a back link).
- Stepper and the **soft primary→teal gradient** on the stepper and each step card header (`EnrollmentWizardChrome`).
- Rounded white cards (`rounded-2xl`, hairline border, light ring).
- Fields use `.reg-input` / `.fk-field`. 2-column grid on md+.
- Step bodies in **`compact` mode** (register + enrollment edit + public `/student-enrollment`): neutral white/gray panels only — no blue/pink/green/amber section washes. Public enrollment uses the same `EnrollmentWizardChrome` + compact steps as register (school logo/brand may still tint primary via CSS variables).
- Step actions stay **in the card footer**, not a navy `fk-actionbar`: primary green Next/Register, white Previous.

## Do not

- Do not replace the navy hero with a white page header or `canvas="ice"`.
- Do not restyle this page to look like grades/users lists.
- Do not revert to the old purple mock in `design-screenshots/admin/student-register__base.png`.
- Do not drop guardian / academic / health / address to flatten back to 3 steps unless asked.
